1. |Case|:**user_login**
```
FUNCTION login(username, password)  
    READ users.txt INTO users (FORMAT: username|password|email)  
    IF username IN users AND users[username]['password'] == password  
        SET current_user = username  
        WRITE username|timestamp TO sessions.txt  
        RETURN True  
    ELSE  
        RETURN False  
    ENDIF  
ENDFUNCTION  

ROUTE /login (POST)  
    username = FORM['username']  
    password = FORM['password']  
    IF login(username, password)  
        SET session['username'] = username  
        REDIRECT TO /home  
    ELSE  
        REDIRECT TO /login  
    ENDIF  
ENDROUTE  
```
